            "expression": "\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 344.84 299.91'><path fill='%230a6046' d='M342.14,140.96l2.7,2.54v-7.72c0-17-11.92-30.84-26.56-30.84h-23.41C278.49,36.7,222.69,0,139.68,0c-52.86,0-59.65,0-109.71,0,0,0,15.03,12.63,15.03,52.4v52.58h-27.68c-5.38,0-10.43-2.08-14.61-6.01l-2.7-2.54v7.72c0,17.01,11.92,30.84,26.56,30.84h18.44s0,29.99,0,29.99h-27.68c-5.38,0-10.43-2.07-14.61-6.01l-2.7-2.54v7.71c0,17,11.92,30.82,26.56,30.82h18.44s0,54.89,0,54.89c0,38.65-15.03,50.06-15.03,50.06h109.71c85.62,0,139.64-36.96,155.38-104.98h32.46c5.38,0,10.43,2.07,14.61,6l2.7,2.54v-7.71c0-17-11.92-30.83-26.56-30.83h-18.9c.32-4.88.49-9.87.49-15s-.18-10.11-.51-14.99h28.17c5.37,0,10.43,2.07,14.61,6.01ZM89.96,15.01h45.86c61.7,0,97.44,27.33,108.1,89.94l-153.96.02V15.01ZM136.21,284.93h-46.26v-89.98l153.87-.02c-9.97,56.66-42.07,88.38-107.61,90ZM247.34,149.96c0,5.13-.11,10.13-.34,14.99l-157.04.02v-29.99l157.05-.02c.22,4.84.33,9.83.33,15Z'/></svg>\"",
